; atomtypes.atp - atom types and masses for the MINFF force field.
;
; This file is read only by pdb2gmx. grompp takes its atom types from the
; [ atomtypes ] sections of the .itp files instead, so nothing here affects a
; normal MINFF run. Names and masses are generated from min.ff/ffnonbonded*.itp
; and cover every type those files define.
;
